<PageTitle>Raycaster</PageTitle>

<div class="row row-cols-auto align-items-center">
	<RadzenIcon Icon="lightbulb"/>
	<p class="pt-3">INTRO</p>
</div>
<div class="w-75 min-vh-100">
	<h1 class="display-1">
		Back when computers were slower, 3D graphics engines could 
		not run in real time. An illusion of 3D was created: 
		<strong>Raycasting</strong>
	</h1>
